# limits.defaults - defaults of the limits of the platform IOC, in autosave's file format.
#
# Restored at every IOC start, before the file that autosave writes at run time
# ($MIST2_SAVE/iocHV/limits.sav), whose values win. So these values apply at the first start and
# whenever the saved file is missing; a limit changed from the GUI is kept in the saved file.
# One line per PV: <PV name> <value>, in the unit of the PV.
#
# OWNER: these are the full scales of the supplies, not limits for operation. Put the real limits
# here (or set them from the GUI, which saves them).
REK-1:current:limit 24
#
# Settings of the discharge current loop LOOP-DIS (EPICS/Db/loop.db). Where each value comes
# from: docs/emulation/LOOP.md, "Settings".
# Set point 22 A (owner, 2026-11-22: "set point below 24 A for now. 22 oughta do it."), until the
# REK150-55 is there. Its maximum stays below the 24 A full scale of the REK150-24, where the REK
# goes into constant current and the loop could only act downward: 23 A, which leaves 22 A a
# little room, is our free choice, TO BE CONFIRMED by the owner.
LOOP-DIS:value:setpoint 22
LOOP-DIS:value:setpoint.DRVL 0
LOOP-DIS:value:setpoint.DRVH 23
# ASSUMED, from the plant MODEL of the emulation, not from MIST-2: SIMC rules at the model's
# steepest point (gain 3.56 A/A, time constant 1.45 s, dead time about 0.3 s with the polling
# and the period) for a closed-loop time constant of 0.5 s. Measure on the machine (LOOP.md).
LOOP-DIS:kp:setpoint 0.5
LOOP-DIS:ki:setpoint 0.35
# A first-order plant needs no derivative: off. Filter time one period (free choice).
LOOP-DIS:kd:setpoint 0
LOOP-DIS:dfilter:setpoint 0.2
# Filament current: at most 90 A, the owner's working point (2026-11-21); at least 80 A (free
# choice: below the model's 12 A point at 85.8 A). 1 A/s (free choice: about 3 A/s of discharge
# current in the model).
LOOP-DIS:outmin:setpoint 80
LOOP-DIS:outmax:setpoint 90
LOOP-DIS:slew:setpoint 1
# Free choices: hand back after 3 missed heartbeat counts (once per second); MANUAL when the
# service's counter (once per cycle, 0.2 s) stood still for 2 s.
LOOP-DIS:stale:setpoint 3
LOOP-DIS:watchdog:setpoint 2
<END>
